From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <x@x>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:00:00 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] 0226: DPU blends a detached app layer under backboardd's

bluedpu_layers=N: N contiguous app buffers below 4 GiB for other
processes' full-width BGRA surfaces (CAMetalLayer drawables). A swap of a
full-width layer 0 under a full-screen layer 1 is flipped as two layers:
each LM gets an idle VIG pipe for layer 0 at blend stage 0 (opaque), the
flipped pipe at stage 1, premultiplied source over. The display holds a
use on both surfaces until their replacements latch.
---
